 by ocean acidification and heating, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Environmental_migration" title="Environmental migration" class="mw-redirect">environmental migration</a> caused by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Desertification" title="Desertification">desertification</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Coastal_flooding" title="Coastal flooding">coastal flooding</a> caused by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Storm" title="Storm">storms</a> and sea level rise.</div></div></div></div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt9"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_using_multiple_image_with_auto_scaled_images"/></span>
